     1968           "Нет заданий на печать ! "
     1969           view-as alert-box .
     1970         Return  .
     1971       End.
     1972       run gbl/prnfilen.w
     1973         (input  ""
     1974         ,input  p-DisabledOptions
     1975         ,input  string(v-report-name )
     1976         ,input  7
     1977         ,output v-user-action
     1978         ,output v-printed
     1979         ) .
     1980       if v-printed then
